{
  "abstract": "Every rank-two plane lattice torus has a piecewise-isometric embedding on the labeled Lutz Type 6 complex. The same spatial vertices give rank nine for the joint angle and marked-modulus map. The construction flips the Type 3 diagonal and matches 24 edge lengths while keeping both periods fixed.",
